<title>USA: Cass ups div to $0.13/shr post split.</title>
<headline>Cass ups div to $0.13/shr post split.</headline>
<dateline>ST. LOUIS 1997-02-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Cass Commercial Corp said on Wednesday that it set a cash dividend on its outstanding shares on a post-split basis of $0.13 a share.</p>
<p>The cash dividend is payable on March 15, 1997 to shareholders of record on March 5, 1997,</p>
<p>The cash dividend is equivalent to $0.26 a share on a pre-split basis, which is an increase of $0.01 per pre-split share over the former $0.25 share dividend.</p>
<p>((-- New York Newsdesk 212 859-1610))</p>
</text>
